WEBVTT

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.310
Umm, Ms. Ghislaine, my father didn't...

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.900
Just Ghislaine. Drop the "Miss."

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:21.850
Okay.

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:25.900
Read this. I can't read, so do it out loud.

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:33.980
"My beloved son, Rudeus,

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:36.980
I'm sure you have no idea what's going on.

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:41.060
I'd tell you to ask that
musclebound strongwoman,

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:45.600
but she's got muscle for brains, so you
won't get a decent explanation from her."

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.350
What was that?!

00:00:47.350 --> 00:00:51.560
P-Please sit down, Ghislaine. That was a joke.

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:52.850
Oh.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:57.400
"I'll cut to the chase: I got you your job.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.730
You'll tutor a nine-year-old young lady in Roa!"

00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:02.980
A job! The one I asked him for.

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:04.190
Finally!

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:07.810
But in that case, what did
he have to knock me out for?

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:12.190
"The woman with you is her family's
bodyguard and sword instructor.

00:01:12.190 --> 00:01:16.980
I hear she wants you to teach her,
too, in exchange for training you.

00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:21.690
Don't laugh at her for asking just
because she's got muscle for brains."

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:24.310
What did you say?!

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:29.350
"But she is a Sword King. I promise
you won't find a better sword instructor.

00:01:29.350 --> 00:01:33.060
I've never beaten her even once, except in bed."

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:36.270
Some things are better
left unwritten, stupid dad!

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:40.600
He really is a hit with the ladies.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:43.310
"For the next five years, until you turn 12,

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:47.690
you'll teach reading, writing,
arithmetic, and magic there.

00:01:47.690 --> 00:01:52.310
During that time, I forbid you to return,
send letters, or make any contact."

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:54.350
What?

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:58.980
That's because I sensed you were
beginning to depend on Sylphiette.

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:01.600
I decided that that wouldn't be good for her.

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:04.020
You've done it now, Paul!

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:08.270
You'll work, earn money, and live independently.

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:12.230
I can't wait to see the person you'll become.

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:15.520
Your wise, awe-inspiring father, Paul.

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:18.770
You sent me off by brute force.
What's wise about that?

00:02:18.770 --> 00:02:21.980
Paul sure loves you.

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:25.190
"P.S.

00:02:25.190 --> 00:02:29.600
The young lady is fair game, but hands
off the strongwoman. She's mine."

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:30.520
He says.

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:33.310
I see. Send that letter to Zenith.

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:35.730
Will do.

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:40.440
I have my reservations,
but this is fine for now.

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:42.480
Yeah, it's for the best.

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:45.440
Sylphie might be left on her own,

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:50.350
but she'll never grow if she doesn't
solve her problems for herself.

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:52.940
I can't let myself depend on her either.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:55.600
I've got no regrets. None.

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:58.650
Still,

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.980
I'd like to see her at least once a year.

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:14.440
So many beast people.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:19.100
Ghislaine's one, too.
Maybe they're not that rare in this world.

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:25.150
Thanks.

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:35.850
Hi.

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:39.940
Pleased to meet you. I'm Rudeus Greyrat.

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:42.940
A noble says hello by
drawing back his left foot,

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:46.900
making a circle with his
right hand, and bowing slightly.

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:50.480
Like this?

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:52.440
Yes, that's not bad.

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:54.770
Sit down.

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:59.810
I am Philip Boreas Greyrat,
the mayor of this city.

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:01.980
I suppose I'm Paul's cousin.

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:04.400
Huh? That means... what, exactly?

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:06.900
Does that mean we're related?

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:08.020
I suppose so.

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:11.150
Oh, I see. I get it now.

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:14.520
That scoundrel used his family connections.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.730
That said,

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:18.190
I never thought our family was so high-status.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.850
And? How much do you know?

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:24.060
That if I educate a young
lady here for five years,

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:28.230
you'll help pay for my
enrollment in Magic University.

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:29.270
That's all?

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:31.060
Yes.

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:34.020
Good grief. I see he hasn't changed.

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:37.560
Oh well. I'll introduce you to my daughter.

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:39.230
Then, we'll talk.

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:40.730
Okay.

00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:47.400
I hear you're quite impressive for your age.

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:49.480
My master deserves all the credit.

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:51.770
You have a way with words.

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:54.600
I hope you don't seduce my darling little girl.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.850
You know I'm only seven, right?

00:04:56.850 --> 00:05:01.600
I already told Paul, but my
daughter is just a little willful.

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:04.560
She only takes to a select few people.

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:09.270
I don't expect much from you,
but I'll try you out because Paul asked.

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:11.520
You're awfully frank about that.

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:13.020
Confident, are you?

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:16.350
I won't know until I meet her, but...

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:22.350
Eris, I've brought a new teacher for you.

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:28.230
"Intense."

00:05:28.230 --> 00:05:30.690
That was my first impression.

00:05:30.690 --> 00:05:34.440
All my senses are flashing danger signals.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:43.400
Pleased to meet you. I'm Rudeus Greyrat.

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:47.020
What?! You're younger than me!

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:49.520
I don't believe my age is relevant.

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:51.770
What?! Are you disagreeing with me?!

00:05:51.770 --> 00:05:56.150
But you can't do all the things I can, can y--

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:56.770
Huh?

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:59.650
What nerve! Who do you think I am?!

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:01.900
My second impression was "violent."

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:03.520
Why did you hit me?

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:06.400
You're younger and you talk back!

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:17.400
Now do you understand
what it feels like to be hi--

00:06:26.730 --> 00:06:28.400
Wh-What the...?

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:30.850
I'll make you regret hitting me!

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:32.100
Huh?

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:35.690
W-Wait a--

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:41.310
Damn it, Paul,

00:06:41.310 --> 00:06:43.480
where the hell did you send me to?!

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:46.100
Wait! I'll mash you into paste!

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:47.880
"Just a little willful"?

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:48.440
Where'd you go?!

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:49.980
Stop hiding and show yourself!

00:06:48.730 --> 00:06:49.980
Don't be ridiculous.

00:06:49.980 --> 00:06:52.400
That's no young lady!

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:56.650
She's the protagonist of a delinquent manga!

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:02.770
How'd it go?

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:05.600
I've never seen such a vicious creature in my...

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:06.350
Hm?

00:07:06.350 --> 00:07:11.230
Uh, I mean, I've never seen such
an innocent young lady before.

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:17.150
What will you do now? Give up?

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:18.560
I will not.

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:23.270
If I just slink back home,
Father is sure to laugh at me.

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:25.650
Oh, well said.

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:29.190
All the other teachers
admitted defeat at this point.

00:07:29.190 --> 00:07:32.100
But do you have a plan?

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:33.480
Let me think.

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:36.520
I could probably beat her up with magic.

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:38.520
No, that's no good.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:41.770
Beating her in a fight won't make her listen.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:45.600
If I'm not careful,
she might pay me back ten-fold!

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:47.100
That's not funny!

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:50.400
I can't cast healing magic if I can't speak!

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:52.770
Why don't we put on a little act?

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:56.270
It will trick your daughter
into wanting to study.

00:07:56.270 --> 00:07:58.900
Oh? Tell me the details.

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:00.850
I'll do all I can to help.

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:02.270
All right.

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:05.150
In that case, I'd like to ask you to...

00:08:06.440 --> 00:08:08.600
Please relax.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:22.100
I've made my plan. I just hope it works.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:28.310
I'm sick of getting
beaten up like in my old life.

00:08:28.310 --> 00:08:30.900
I have to succeed.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:34.600
Oh, I left the holy relic back in the village.

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:40.100
God,

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:44.230
please, lead me to success.

00:08:56.270 --> 00:08:57.230
Ow!

00:08:57.230 --> 00:09:01.230
They didn't have to be so rough.

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:05.650
It was supposed to be a fairly clean place.

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:09.650
Well, I guess atmosphere can't hurt.

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:14.810
Now, we'll use my magic and
knowledge to escape and return home.

00:09:14.810 --> 00:09:18.770
That'll show her how important education is.

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:24.150
Good morning, My Lady.

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:27.400
What's going on?!

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:31.560
It appears we've been kidnapped and locked up.

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:35.440
If only you could use magic,
you could burn through the ropes easily.

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:37.400
Don't talk nonsense!

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:39.690
Ghislaine! Ghislaine, where are you?!

00:09:39.690 --> 00:09:42.270
Ghislaine! Hey, Ghislaine!

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:42.270
Perfect reaction. Now...

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:44.440
Pipe down, brat!

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:46.980
Oh, nice choice!

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:49.560
She'll never guess it's all an act now!

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:52.060
That hurt! I'll clobber you!

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:53.440
What'd you say?

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:55.940
G-Great acting!

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:57.850
You stink! Stay away from me!

00:09:57.850 --> 00:10:00.190
Who do you think I--

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:08.770
Looks like you don't know your place!

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:11.230
Damn it!

00:10:11.230 --> 00:10:13.520
Who said you got to hit back?!

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:17.060
I-Isn't this overdoing it?

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:32.310
Gross little shit.

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:44.730
You'll pay for this.

00:10:44.730 --> 00:10:48.100
I'll tell Grandfather.

00:10:56.520 --> 00:10:58.940
Divine power is rich and nourishing.

00:10:58.940 --> 00:11:03.060
It offers the strength to rise again
to those who have lost their strength.

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:04.850
Healing.

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:11.650
Heal me all the way.

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.730
You'd just shout again if I did.

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.850
Cast the spell yourself.

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:18.650
I can't. I don't know how.

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:21.560
You could do it if you'd studied.

00:11:22.730 --> 00:11:24.310
Are they quiet now?

00:11:24.310 --> 00:11:25.520
Yeah.

00:11:25.520 --> 00:11:29.190
You didn't kill 'em, did you?
We need 'em in one piece.

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:33.190
Huh? Well, can't we make do
with just the boy if we have to?

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:35.480
No, you can't.

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:39.850
I hope they're just good actors,
but it doesn't sound like it.

00:11:39.850 --> 00:11:42.020
Should I blast them with magic?

00:11:42.020 --> 00:11:46.600
But that's risky when I'm not
sure how strong they are.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:50.810
And I don't want to teach the
young lady that violence is the answer.

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:53.690
She'll never stop punching me then.

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:54.520
Oh well.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:57.900
Either way, my job is the same.

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:03.400
Well, I don't want to die, so I'm leaving.

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:04.230
Goodbye.

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:06.150
Help me!

00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:08.940
I told you to pipe down!

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:11.940
Hey, it won't open!

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:13.850
Bye.

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:26.060
D-Don't leave me here.

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:29.810
Just beat them with violence.
It's your specialty.

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:38.810
Can you promise not to be violent or shout?

00:12:40.350 --> 00:12:42.730
H-Help me.

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:45.190
Can you promise?

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:52.520
Damn it!

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:54.310
Let me.

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:09.310
X-Healing.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:19.310
Okay! We should be fine now!

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:21.900
You promised not to shout, remember?

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:25.310
Why should I have to keep a promise to <i>you</i> ?!

00:13:25.310 --> 00:13:27.520
You little brat!

00:13:27.520 --> 00:13:28.560
Is that so?

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:30.480
I guess this is goodbye, then.

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:32.150
Goodbye.

00:13:33.650 --> 00:13:37.270
Where'd you go?! Get out here, you little shits!

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:42.600
I-I didn't mean that. I won't shout anymore.

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:46.400
You say that, but you'll just
break your promise again.

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:47.940
I will not.

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:51.850
If you do what I say, you can come with me.

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:57.690
It looks like this town is near Roa.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:59.020
I can't read.

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:00.650
Reading comes in handy.

00:14:00.650 --> 00:14:02.600
It lists the coach fares, too.

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:05.730
If you knew math,
you could get back on your own.

00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:08.230
You should just do it all, then.

00:14:08.230 --> 00:14:11.020
I'm not your servant or employee.

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:13.060
What? You're my tutor.

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:14.190
No, I'm not.

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:15.020
Huh?

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:19.440
You said you didn't like me,
My Lady, so I haven't been hired yet.

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:10.350
My Lady, we're in Roa.

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:12.350
We should be safe now.

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:14.480
Yes, we should.

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:17.350
She's sleepy now she can relax, huh?

00:15:17.350 --> 00:15:21.190
There were mistakes,
but this is mostly according to plan.

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:25.850
She respects me a little now... I hope.

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:30.480
You work at the manor!

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:41.440
Wait!

00:15:54.690 --> 00:15:56.480
What is it, brat?

00:15:56.480 --> 00:15:58.940
You could've gone home if you stayed put.

00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:01.190
Let go of m--

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:07.190
Please return that girl.

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:09.980
I can't do that.

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:15.230
There's somewhere I need
little Lady Eris to go for me.

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:19.810
Looks like you're better
at magic than I thought.

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:23.770
Join us. We'll give you a cut.

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:26.190
How much would that be, exactly?

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:29.270
How does 100 Asura gold pieces sound?

00:16:30.400 --> 00:16:35.310
Would that pay for two
enrollments in Magic University?

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:41.940
Oh, yes. It could pay for
ten with some left over.

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:43.900
I see.

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:47.190
That's a tempting offer.

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:51.810
That little girl's given me a hell of a time.

00:16:51.810 --> 00:16:55.940
If you become her tutor,
she'll do the same to you.

00:16:55.940 --> 00:16:59.230
Even at your age, you must
know the value of money.

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:03.150
If you do, then raise your hand real slow.

00:17:03.150 --> 00:17:04.270
I do.

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:08.020
But I also know there are things
more valuable than money.

00:17:08.020 --> 00:17:10.100
Cut the crap!

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:11.520
It's not crap.

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:12.600
What?!

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:18.190
Thinking back, I've never had to worry
about money in my life until now.

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:20.480
I spent nearly 20 years as a bum.

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:23.600
Half my life wallowing in VNs and MMOs.

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:28.770
That narrow experience taught me what
betraying the young lady would mean

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:32.150
and what saving her now will lead to.

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:34.230
Money can't buy <i>dere</i> !

00:17:34.230 --> 00:17:35.230
Huh?!

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:37.980
Whoops. I said that out loud.

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:44.310
What?!

00:17:44.310 --> 00:17:46.230
Shit!

00:17:58.440 --> 00:17:59.690
Damn!

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:01.690
Hey, brat!

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:06.600
Sorry!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:17.480
Tricky little...

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:19.020
What?!

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:21.020
Yeah! I won!

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:24.310
Not so fast!

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:30.310
He's not just desperate. Paul told me.

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:33.650
The North God Style has
sword-throwing techniques!

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:09.940
Ghislaine! Ghislaine!

00:19:14.190 --> 00:19:16.020
Hey, Rudeus.

00:19:17.150 --> 00:19:18.520
Rudeus.

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:20.190
Rudeus!

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:23.230
Is this all of them?

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:27.560
Yes. Thank you very much.

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:30.190
There was an explosion, so I came look.

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:32.690
I'm glad I did.

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:34.730
But what the hell happened?

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:37.600
I heard you two went out, but...

00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:40.400
Ghislaine.

00:20:03.150 --> 00:20:05.520
Eris!

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:07.980
You're back awfully late.

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:11.230
What happened?

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:17.520
Lord Philip, it's not what it looks like!

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:19.400
It's a misunderstanding!

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:23.020
So, that's it.

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:24.560
Take him away.

00:20:24.560 --> 00:20:26.940
Lord Philip, please forgive me!

00:20:26.940 --> 00:20:29.850
Lord Philip!

00:20:29.850 --> 00:20:32.440
Are you all right, Eris?

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:44.650
The promise was until we got
home, so I can talk now, right?!

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:45.810
Oh.

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:48.770
Yes, it's fine now.

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:52.980
I failed, huh?

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:55.690
Well, that makes sense.

00:20:55.690 --> 00:21:01.230
I got caught up in my plan and
ended up needing Ghislaine to save me.

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:03.400
I almost died.

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:06.770
Without Ghislaine, I'd be dead for sure.

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:09.350
I hadn't even thought about it,

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:13.560
but what will happen to me if I die again?

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:24.440
Wait!

00:21:25.940 --> 00:21:29.850
I'll give you special
permission to call me "Eris"!

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:31.730
Special permission, understand?!

00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:33.440
Huh?

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:37.270
So, you mean... it's okay?

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:40.940
You mean I can work here?

00:21:42.850 --> 00:21:45.520
Thank you very much, Lady Eris.

00:21:45.520 --> 00:21:48.940
No "lady"! Just "Eris"!

00:21:53.400 --> 00:21:57.150
I wonder if I earned affection
points for that last choice.

00:21:57.150 --> 00:22:02.060
Or does she plan to get her revenge
once I'm officially her tutor?

00:22:02.060 --> 00:22:03.690
Well, either way,

00:22:03.690 --> 00:22:08.850
for now, I think I'll celebrate
landing my first ever job.

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:11.970
Episode 5

00:22:08.970 --> 00:22:11.970
A Young Lady and Violence

00:23:41.980 --> 00:23:46.980
Next time

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:46.980
A Day Off in Roa
